   "id": "2f92ea05",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The ERP CORE resource contains data from 40 participants (25 female, 15 male; age M = 21.5 years, SD = 2.87, range 18-30; 38 right-handed; @kappenman2021). Following the exclusion criteria applied by @kappenman2021, three participants were excluded. Participants 1 and 16 had fewer than 50% of face trials remaining after artifact rejection, and participant 5 had artifacts on more than 25% of trials (as listed in the resource's Subject_Summary spreadsheet). The final sample consisted of 37 participants (24 female, 13 male; age M = 21.5 years, SD = 2.96, range 18-30; 35 right-handed).\n",
    "\n",
